                    <p>When engineering web pages, it is easy to accumulate third-party scripts, unneeded layout frameworks, and excessive animations. <strong>Atharva.OS</strong> was designed under a strict set of constraints: zero unnecessary HTTP requests, clean semantic DOM structure, and immediate text rendering.</p>
                    
