                        <li><strong>Tailwind CSS Utilities:</strong> Styling directly via predictable utility scales to maintain visual consistency.</li>
                        <li><strong>Vanilla JS Interactivity:</strong> Handling modal state, filtering, and theme switching natively without bulky runtime frameworks.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h3 class="text-brand-900 dark:text-brand-100 font-bold text-base mt-6 mb-2">Result:</h3>
                    <p>By focusing on fundamentals, the resulting platform renders instantly and maintains readability across any mobile or desktop viewport.</p>
